<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 72px 0; background: var(--color-bg); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-beige);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px;">
    
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
      <span style="font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-brown);">
        {{ section.settings.subheading | default: 'Got Questions?' }}
      </span>
      <h2 class="heading-serif" style="font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem); margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 12px;">
        {{ section.settings.heading | default: 'Frequently Asked Questions' }}
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Accordion Items -->
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
      
      <div class="accordion-item" style="border: 1px solid var(--color-beige); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: #FFF; overflow: hidden;">
        <button type="button" class="accordion-header" style="width: 100%; padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; text-align: left; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-text);">
          <span>Are your products really 100% hand crocheted?</span>
          <svg class="accordion-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="transition: transform 0.2s;"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content" style="display: none; padding: 0 20px 18px; font-size: 14px; color: rgba(51,44,40,0.8); line-height: 1.6;">
          Yes! Every single item in our boutique is crocheted by hand using ergonomic aluminum hooks and pure yarns. There are currently no machines in the world that can replicate the true crochet stitch.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="accordion-item" style="border: 1px solid var(--color-beige); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: #FFF; overflow: hidden;">
        <button type="button" class="accordion-header" style="width: 100%; padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; text-align: left; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-text);">
          <span>How do I wash and care for my crochet items?</span>
          <svg class="accordion-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="transition: transform 0.2s;"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content" style="display: none; padding: 0 20px 18px; font-size: 14px; color: rgba(51,44,40,0.8); line-height: 1.6;">
          We recommend gentle hand washing in cool water using mild liquid detergent. Never wring or twist. Gently press out excess water with a clean towel and lay flat on a dry surface to dry.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="accordion-item" style="border: 1px solid var(--color-beige); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: #FFF; overflow: hidden;">
        <button type="button" class="accordion-header" style="width: 100%; padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; text-align: left; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-text);">
          <span>How long do custom bespoke orders take?</span>
          <svg class="accordion-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="transition: transform 0.2s;"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content" style="display: none; padding: 0 20px 18px; font-size: 14px; color: rgba(51,44,40,0.8); line-height: 1.6;">
          Custom orders take between 7 to 14 business days to craft depending on stitch complexity and yarn availability, followed by 3-5 days for courier transit.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="accordion-item" style="border: 1px solid var(--color-beige); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: #FFF; overflow: hidden;">
        <button type="button" class="accordion-header" style="width: 100%; padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; text-align: left; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-text);">
          <span>What is your return & exchange policy?</span>
          <svg class="accordion-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="transition: transform 0.2s;"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content" style="display: none; padding: 0 20px 18px; font-size: 14px; color: rgba(51,44,40,0.8); line-height: 1.6;">
          We accept returns or exchanges for unused standard collection items within 7 days of delivery. Personalized bespoke custom orders cannot be returned unless damaged during transit.
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ Section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subheading",
      "label": "Subheading",
      "default": "Got Questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Frequently Asked Questions"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "FAQ Section"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
